<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-PAU WIN FRENCH CUP, QUALIFY FOR EUROPEAN CUP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-PAU WIN FRENCH CUP, QUALIFY FOR EUROPEAN CUP.</headline>
<text>
<p>NIMES, France, April 26 (reuter) - Pau beat Bourgoin 13-11</p>
<p>(halftime 3-8) in the French Cup final on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pau - Try: David Dantiac. Conversion: David Aucagne.</p>
<p>Penalties: Aucagne 2.</p>
<p>Bourgoin - Try: Laurent Leflamand. Penalties: Patrice Favre</p>
<p>2.</p>
<p>Attendance: 13,000</p>
<p>Pau qualify for European Cup next season.</p>
</text>
